    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔧 CONFIGURATION – Workflow Settings\nThis section defines all workflow configuration variables:\n• folderPath: the local folder containing input videos\n• uploadedFolderPath: the folder where uploaded videos will be moved\n• Optional metadata such as privacy, title prefix, etc.\nUsed as the global setup for the entire workflow.\n\n",
        "height": 576,
        "width": 608,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1024,
        -176
      ],
      "id": "d2aa1291-24c5-4fd9-81c9-c352993a419f",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📂 SCAN SOURCE FOLDER – List Files in Directory\nThis section scans the video folder using a Linux command (ls).\nThe node returns:\n• stdout → file list\n• stderr → error if folder not found\nThis prepares the raw list of files for further filtering.\n",
        "height": 576,
        "width": 256,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -416,
        -176
      ],
      "id": "dcadb38c-e887-4692-aa29-fd3dbf2272f2",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎞️ PARSE & FILTER VIDEO FILES\nThis section:\n• Detects missing or invalid folder paths\n• Splits the raw file list\n• Filters by video extensions (.mp4, .mov, .mkv, .avi, ...)\n• Generates: fileName + filePath\n• Handles the \"NO VIDEOS\" scenario\n",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 1168
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -176
      ],
      "id": "0845f536-be62-45cc-972d-5d0e048995e3",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 READ VIDEO FILE – Load Binary Data\nReads the selected video file from disk and loads it as binary\n(binary property: \"data\").\nThis binary payload is then passed to the YouTube Upload node.\n",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 784,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
