    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📦 MOVE UPLOADED FILE – Post-Upload Cleanup\n\nMoves successfully uploaded videos to the \"uploaded\" directory\nto avoid re-uploading the same files in future runs.\nUses Linux commands:\nmkdir -p ... && mv ...\n",
        "height": 496,
